        "comments": "The assembly ddHelOela1.hap1.1 is based on 59x PacBio data and Arima2 Hi-C data generated by the Darwin Tree of Life Project\n(https://www.darwintreeoflife.org/). The assembly process included the following sequence of steps: initial PacBio assembly generation with Hifiasm in Hi-C integrated assembly mode, and Hi-C based scaffolding with YaHS. The mitochondrial and chloroplast genomes were assembled using OATK. Finally, each haplotype assembly was analysed and manually improved using TreeVal. Chromosome-scale scaffolds confirmed by the Hi-C data have been named in order of size. Multiple haplotypic inversions were observed on chromosome 3 (102.8-130.2 Mbp and 144-197.8 Mbp) and chromosome 5 (72.5-93.9 Mbp).",
